  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the skillet over medium heat with binchotan charcoal for a smoky flavor.",
    "Add coconut oil to the skillet and swirl it around to coat the bottom.",
    "Add garlic and ginger to the skillet and saute until fragrant.",
    "Add makrut lime leaves to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add salmon fillets to the skillet, skin side up, and cook for 4 minutes.",
    "Flip the salmon fillets over and cook for an additional 4 minutes.",
    "Add lemon juice, turmeric, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer the skillet for 2 minutes to allow the flavors to meld."
